{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6f7368d356cfaab85fcd0d35424c2c765b79ecbe68e0980053b3c863b69f1a6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18d022ff81ce63ed087878856b074b5bf831ead3953e40778877ab6ab04ccd7b",
      "text": "明天就是圣诞约会的拍摄了呢。\n我现在就很期待看大家的拍摄了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18b7104e272deebaa1988660716159f25e88004b35c10ae40a446dd1006beb3f",
      "text": "大概是被大家挑选礼物时\n那认真的表情感染了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4da63fd24363d1ad266607921f498c4e500d8dbb63fdf5b9bcba48979b6a550",
      "text": "画面浮现在眼前了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9283233621d4fa46720be496dfa500c78db3f3c67e9ae9a00d04a8c08dd1e9be",
      "text": "我想应该正如制作人想象的那样哦。\n要是没有别的工作就能过来了，真遗憾呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c6a056f0b6557adad3144d911950a1960475940cdf5f8b9c85f2cfa466cfb9",
      "text": "下次要是你也能去就好了呢。挑选礼物的时候，\n大家提到了好多次你的名字哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_b:2_4_007_01_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2ea6370a01fb6f504add95ad2a0bae0563355682c7178372915e809c1a8d786",
      "text": "那么，明天见。在集合地点见吧。\n晚安，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
